    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD CHANNEL</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/5733b7e8edd00797e1a9c4efa4e24d99.poster.avif?t=1749604486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/5733b7e8edd00797e1a9c4efa4e24d99.webm?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/5733b7e8edd00797e1a9c4efa4e24d99.mp4?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Direct Contact \u2013 The Ultimate Multiplayer Co-op &amp; Single-Player Tactical Experience</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the boots of an elite special forces operative in Direct Contact, a next-generation UE5  single-player tactical shooter that delivers unparalleled realism and intensity. Designed for those who crave authentic military combat, this game immerses you in a world where every shot counts, every decision matters, and every mission tests skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With advanced ballistics simulation, precise weapon handling, and intelligent enemy AI, every engagement is high-stakes. Whether you're breaching enemy compounds, clearing buildings in close-quarters combat (CQB), or engaging foes at long range, teamwork, coordination, or strategic solo play is crucial to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/c67ab0fa8b4a4bdaf41970fe2728b3a9.poster.avif?t=1749604486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/c67ab0fa8b4a4bdaf41970fe2728b3a9.webm?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/c67ab0fa8b4a4bdaf41970fe2728b3a9.mp4?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">True Tactical Gameplay \u2013 Play solo, using real-world military tactics to overcome dynamic and unpredictable enemy forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic Weapon Systems \u2013 Every firearm is meticulously modeled for accuracy, handling, and realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense  Single-Player Combat Scenarios \u2013 Navigate diverse environments, from dense urban landscapes to open battlefields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced AI Enemies \u2013 Face foes that react intelligently, forcing you to adjust strategies whether playing alone or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive Audio &amp; Visuals \u2013 Stunning graphics and cinematic sound design pull you deeper into the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a seasoned veteran of tactical shooters or new to the genre, Direct Contact offers an experience where skill, precision, and teamwork\u2014or individual tactics\u2014determine your success.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The mission is yours. Are you ready to engage?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Air Support in Direct Contact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Direct Contact</strong>, airstrikes are more than just firepower\u2014they\u2019re a <strong>visually stunning and immersive experience</strong>. You'll be able to <strong>call in strikes</strong> from <strong>iconic aircraft</strong> like the <strong>Eurofighter, F-18, A-10 Warthog, and Sukhoi Su-25</strong>, using <strong>laser-guided munitions or manual target designation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When missiles launch, the process is as <strong>realistic as possible</strong>\u2014from the <strong>missile bay ejector deploying the payload</strong> to the explosive impact on the battlefield. <strong>Every detail is designed for immersion</strong>, making air support a powerful and dynamic tool in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/800a5f69478147543f4eedd40403f941.poster.avif?t=1749604486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/800a5f69478147543f4eedd40403f941.webm?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/800a5f69478147543f4eedd40403f941.mp4?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Our Goal for Direct Contact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our mission is to create an immersive and intense tactical shooter with realistic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every update pushes Direct Contact closer to our vision, improving customization, and enhancing performance. This is a community-driven game, and we\u2019re committed to constant improvements and innovation to make it the best tactical experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember this is still an Early Acces Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/1b1fcb9b64d99d6f50e244382acb24b9.poster.avif?t=1749604486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/1b1fcb9b64d99d6f50e244382acb24b9.webm?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/1b1fcb9b64d99d6f50e244382acb24b9.mp4?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Direct Contact \u2013 The Ultimate Multiplayer Co-op &amp; Single-Player Tactical Experience</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the boots of an elite special forces operative in Direct Contact, a next-generation UE5  single-player tactical shooter that delivers unparalleled realism and intensity. Designed for those who crave authentic military combat, this game immerses you in a world where every shot counts, every decision matters, and every mission tests skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With advanced ballistics simulation, precise weapon handling, and intelligent enemy AI, every engagement is high-stakes. Whether you're breaching enemy compounds, clearing buildings in close-quarters combat (CQB), or engaging foes at long range, teamwork, coordination, or strategic solo play is crucial to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/c67ab0fa8b4a4bdaf41970fe2728b3a9.poster.avif?t=1749604486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/c67ab0fa8b4a4bdaf41970fe2728b3a9.webm?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/c67ab0fa8b4a4bdaf41970fe2728b3a9.mp4?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">True Tactical Gameplay \u2013 Play solo, using real-world military tactics to overcome dynamic and unpredictable enemy forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic Weapon Systems \u2013 Every firearm is meticulously modeled for accuracy, handling, and realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense  Single-Player Combat Scenarios \u2013 Navigate diverse environments, from dense urban landscapes to open battlefields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced AI Enemies \u2013 Face foes that react intelligently, forcing you to adjust strategies whether playing alone or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive Audio &amp; Visuals \u2013 Stunning graphics and cinematic sound design pull you deeper into the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a seasoned veteran of tactical shooters or new to the genre, Direct Contact offers an experience where skill, precision, and teamwork\u2014or individual tactics\u2014determine your success.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The mission is yours. Are you ready to engage?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Air Support in Direct Contact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Direct Contact</strong>, airstrikes are more than just firepower\u2014they\u2019re a <strong>visually stunning and immersive experience</strong>. You'll be able to <strong>call in strikes</strong> from <strong>iconic aircraft</strong> like the <strong>Eurofighter, F-18, A-10 Warthog, and Sukhoi Su-25</strong>, using <strong>laser-guided munitions or manual target designation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When missiles launch, the process is as <strong>realistic as possible</strong>\u2014from the <strong>missile bay ejector deploying the payload</strong> to the explosive impact on the battlefield. <strong>Every detail is designed for immersion</strong>, making air support a powerful and dynamic tool in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/800a5f69478147543f4eedd40403f941.poster.avif?t=1749604486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/800a5f69478147543f4eedd40403f941.webm?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/800a5f69478147543f4eedd40403f941.mp4?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Our Goal for Direct Contact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our mission is to create an immersive and intense tactical shooter with realistic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every update pushes Direct Contact closer to our vision, improving customization, and enhancing performance. This is a community-driven game, and we\u2019re committed to constant improvements and innovation to make it the best tactical experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember this is still an Early Acces Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/1b1fcb9b64d99d6f50e244382acb24b9.poster.avif?t=1749604486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/1b1fcb9b64d99d6f50e244382acb24b9.webm?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084450/extras/1b1fcb9b64d99d6f50e244382acb24b9.mp4?t=1749604486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p>",
